
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>MemberShare | Savings Around the World</title>
<meta name="description" content="One membership. Savings around the world. Discover MemberShare, an international savings network connecting members and participating businesses.">
<style>
:root {
  --green:#123d32;
  --green2:#1d5947;
  --gold:#d8b66a;
  --cream:#f7f5ef;
  --ink:#202c27;
  --muted:#68756e;
}
* {box-sizing:border-box}
html {scroll-behavior:smooth}
body {
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  color:var(--ink);
  background:#fff;
  line-height:1.6;
}
header {
  background:var(--green);
  color:white;
  padding:17px 6%;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:12px;
}
.logo {
  font-size:25px;
  font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:.4px;
}
.logo span {color:var(--gold)}
nav {display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav a {
  color:white;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-size:13px;
}
nav a:hover {color:var(--gold)}
.hero {
  background:linear-gradient(130deg,#10372d,#28604b);
  color:white;
  padding:90px 8%;
  text-align:center;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,65px);
  line-height:1.1;
  margin:0 auto 20px;
  max-width:850px;
}
.hero h1 span {color:var(--gold)}
.hero p {
  font-size:19px;
  max-width:680px;
  margin:0 auto 30px;
  color:#e7eee9;
}
.button {
  display:inline-block;
  padding:14px 25px;
  border-radius:5px;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin:5px;
}
.gold {background:var(--gold);color:#18382d}
.outline {border:1px solid white;color:white}
section {padding:65px 8%}
.section-title {
  text-align:center;
  max-width:760px;
  margin:0 auto 38px;
}
.section-title h2 {
  font-size:32px;
  color:var(--green);
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.section-title p {color:var(--muted)}
.grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
  gap:20px;
  max-width:1100px;
  margin:auto;
}
.panel {
  background:var(--cream);
  border-radius:9px;
  padding:26px;
}
.panel h3 {color:var(--green);margin-top:0}
.number {
  color:#b18b3d;
  font-size:28px;
  font-weight:bold;
}
.dark-section {
  background:var(--green);
  color:white;
}
.dark-section h2,.dark-section h3 {color:var(--gold)}
.dark-section p {color:#e5ece7}
.prices {
  text-align:center;
  background:white;
  border:1px solid #e4e3dc;
  border-radius:9px;
  padding:27px;
}
.price {
  font-size:31px;
  color:var(--green);
  font-weight:bold;
}
.price small {font-size:14px;font-weight:normal}
.note {
  font-size:13px;
  color:var(--muted);
  max-width:760px;
  margin:22px auto 0;
  text-align:center;
}
form {
  max-width:650px;
  margin:25px auto;
  display:grid;
  gap:13px;
}
input,select,textarea {
  width:100%;
  padding:14px;
  border:1px solid #d4d9d4;
  border-radius:5px;
  font:inherit;
  background:white;
}
textarea {min-height:110px}
button {
  background:var(--green);
  color:white;
  border:0;
  padding:15px;
  border-radius:5px;
  font-size:16px;
  font-weight:bold;
  cursor:pointer;
}
button:hover {background:var(--green2)}
.center {text-align:center}
footer {
  background:#102b24;
  color:white;
  padding:35px 8%;
  text-align:center;
}
footer a {color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none}
footer p {font-size:13px;color:#d1ddd6}
@media(max-width:600px) {
  header {justify-content:center;text-align:center}
  nav {justify-content:center}
  .hero {padding:65px 6%}
  section {padding:48px 6%}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">Member<span>Share</span></div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#how">How It Works</a>
    <a href="#membership">Membership</a>
    <a href="#business">Businesses</a>
    <a href="#corporate">Partners</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<div class="hero">
  <h1>One Membership.<br><span>Savings Around the World.</span></h1>
  <p>
    Discover a better way to save on everyday purchases.
    MemberShare connects members with participating businesses
    offering exclusive savings and benefits.
  </p>
  <a class="button gold" href="#membership">Explore Membership</a>
  <a class="button outline" href="#business">For Businesses</a>
</div>

<section id="how">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>How MemberShare Works</h2>
    <p>A simple idea that benefits both consumers and businesses.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="number">01</div>
      <h3>Become a Member</h3>
      <p>Choose an affordable membership priced for your country.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="number">02</div>
      <h3>Discover Savings</h3>
      <p>Explore participating restaurants, stores and services.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="number">03</div>
      <h3>Save Money</h3>
      <p>Use available offers according to each participating business's terms.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="number">04</div>
      <h3>Keep Discovering</h3>
      <p>Find new participating businesses and additional opportunities to save.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dark-section">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Built for a Global Community</h2>
    <p>
      Our vision is to connect members with businesses across
      countries and continents, while keeping membership affordable
      in each local market.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div>
      <h3>Worldwide Vision</h3>
      <p>One membership network designed to grow across international markets.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Local Pricing</h3>
      <p>Membership prices adapted to local currencies and purchasing power.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Real Value</h3>
      <p>Offers selected to provide meaningful savings to members.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="membership">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Membership Pricing</h2>
    <p>Our proposed founding-market prices.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="prices">
      <h3>United States</h3>
      <div class="price">$9.99 <small>/ month</small></div>
      <p>$99.99 annually</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prices">
      <h3>United Kingdom</h3>
      <div class="price">£7.99 <small>/ month</small></div>
      <p>£79.99 annually</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prices">
      <h3>Canada</h3>
      <div class="price">C$12.99 <small>/ month</small></div>
      <p>C$129.99 annually</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="note">
    These are proposed prices, not active subscription offers.
    Membership enrollment and payments will open when the service
    is ready. Additional country pricing will be announced as markets launch.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="business" class="dark-section">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>For Businesses</h2>
    <p>
      Reach new customers. Encourage repeat visits.
      Give consumers another reason to choose your business.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div>
      <h3>No Upfront Fees</h3>
      <p>Our proposed founding partnership does not require an upfront listing fee.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>You Choose the Offer</h3>
      <p>Businesses determine their discounts, locations and redemption conditions.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Grow Your Reach</h3>
      <p>Become part of an international savings network.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="center" style="margin-top:30px">
    <a class="button gold" href="#application">Propose a Member Offer</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="application">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Business Enrollment</h2>
    <p>
      Interested in participating? Tell us about your business
      and the savings you would like to offer.
    </p>
  </div>
  <form onsubmit="sendForm(event,'Business Application')">
    <input name="business" placeholder="Business name" required>
    <input name="contact" placeholder="Contact person's name" required>
    <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Business email" required>
    <select name="country" required>
      <option value="">Select country</option>
      <option>United States</option>
      <option>United Kingdom</option>
      <option>Canada</option>
      <option>Other</option>
    </select>
    <input name="category" placeholder="Business type">
    <input name="offer" placeholder="Proposed member discount or benefit">
    <textarea name="comments" placeholder="Additional information"></textarea>
    <button type="submit">Submit Business Proposal</button>
  </form>
</section>

<section id="corporate">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Corporate Partnerships</h2>
    <p>
      We welcome conversations with established companies
      interested in exploring international MemberShare partnerships.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="panel center">
    <h3>Let's Explore What's Possible</h3>
    <p>
      We are particularly interested in speaking with restaurant
      groups, retail companies and international brands.
    </p>
    <a class="button gold" style="background:var(--gold)" 
       href="mailto:membershare.ventura@gmail.com?subject=Corporate%20Partnership%20Inquiry">
       Contact MemberShare
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="center">
  <h2 style="color:var(--green)">A Better Way to Save</h2>
  <p>MemberShare. Making everyday savings accessible around the world.</p>
  <a class="button gold" href="mailto:membershare.ventura@gmail.com?subject=MemberShare%20Information">
    Contact Us
  </a>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="logo">Member<span>Share</span></div>
  <p>One Membership. Savings Around the World.</p>
  <p><a href="mailto:membershare.ventura@gmail.com">membershare.ventura@gmail.com</a></p>
  <p>MemberShare is developing its international network. Participating offers and membership availability will be announced as markets launch.</p>
  <p>© 2026 MemberShare. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

<script>
function sendForm(event, subject) {
  event.preventDefault();
  const form = event.target;
  const data = new FormData(form);
  let body = "";
  for (const [key, value] of data.entries()) {
    body += key + ": " + value + "\n";
  }
  const link = "mailto:membershare.ventura@gmail.com"
    + "?subject=" + encodeURIComponent(subject)
    + "&body=" + encodeURIComponent(body);
  window.location.href = link;
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
